/E (4. Advanced System Routing)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 725 0 R
/E (Manifold Distribution: For complex layouts, such as in bathrooms or industrial stations, use 2-way or 3-way brass manifolds. This allows for a centralized distribution point, making the system easier to manage and reducing the overall number of individual fittings required across the network.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
